I might lose interest.

45:10.309 --> 45:12.010
(CROWD CHEERING)

45:13.947 --> 45:16.348
You did it!
Yay!

45:16.348 --> 45:17.849
Hooray!
I have your sandwich.

45:17.849 --> 45:21.854
Yay! My what?
Oh! Thank you, Biggs.

45:21.854 --> 45:24.757
Yay! I'm part of things,
too. Yay!

45:24.757 --> 45:25.758
(ALL CHEERING)

45:28.227 --> 45:29.662
The end.

45:31.063 --> 45:33.064
(ALL CHEERING)

45:33.064 --> 45:35.568
.
Wow, Dad, thanks for
keeping us entertained

45:35.568 --> 45:37.068
.
That was a great story

45:37.068 --> 45:41.573
Yeah, but didn't
Robot Chickenalready
do this three months ago?

45:41.573 --> 45:43.074
I wouldn't worry
about it, Chris.

45:43.576 --> 45:45.577
I don't think
people are even aware
of that show's existence.

45:46.078 --> 45:47.078
Well, I don't know, Dad.

45:47.078 --> 45:49.081
I think a decent
number of people
watch it.

45:49.081 --> 45:50.081
Oh, really?
Define "decent."

45:50.081 --> 45:52.584
I think it's
the highest rated show
on Cartoon Network,

45:53.085 --> 45:55.086
and the Star Warsepisode
doubled that audience.

45:55.086 --> 45:58.089
Well, yeah,
but double 10 people is,
like, 20 people,

45:58.089 --> 46:00.091
so what kind of numbers
are we talking
about here, you know?

46:00.592 --> 46:02.594
,
Don't be glib
about this stuff, Dad.
It's a legitimate show

46:03.094 --> 46:04.597
and they beat
you to the punch.

46:04.597 --> 46:06.097
I don't know
about that, Chris.

46:06.598 --> 46:10.102
I mean, to me,
a legitimate show is
on ABC, CBS, NBC,

46:10.602 --> 46:12.605
you know,
one of the real networks.

46:12.605 --> 46:14.105
I don't know
about that, Dad.

46:14.105 --> 46:15.106
And besides,
what's up with that

46:15.106 --> 46:17.108
15 minute runtime?
What is that?

46:17.108 --> 46:20.111
That's like 15 minutes
of guys playing
with Star Warsdolls.

46:20.111 --> 46:23.114
Oh, yay, tune me in to that.
Oh, so you do
know the show!

46:23.616 --> 46:25.116
I read part of
a review online.

46:25.116 --> 46:27.118
I am not a fan.

46:27.118 --> 46:29.255
!
You know, Dad,
you're a real jerk

